{"id": "34352", "title": "幸福花", "author": "岑凯伦", "category": "文学名著", "count": 114, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34352.htm", "intro": "丁翠湖是一个柔情万千的女孩，她对留英回港的赵天龙一见钟情后，几乎为爱情付出了自己的一切，无私纯洁的爱终于为翠湖带来了终生的幸福。　　书中也对赵天龙的第一个恋人史芝芝那种专横跋扈、嫉妒自私的阴暗心理作了鞭挞与遣责，尽管她耍尽了种种阴谋手段和卑鄙伎俩，也无法夺走赵天龙与丁翠湖的纯洁高尚的爱情，她的炉焰终于在赵天龙与丁翠湖的爱火中消散了……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34352", "chapters": [{"title": "第1页", "file": "2184378.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2184379.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2184380.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2184381.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2184382.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2184383.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2184384.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2184385.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2184386.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2184387.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2184388.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2184389.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2184390.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2184391.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2184392.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2184393.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2184394.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2184395.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2184396.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2184397.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2184398.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2184399.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2184400.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "2184401.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第25页", "file": "2184402.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第26页", "file": "